{
  "filetype": "passage",
  "next_sid": 19,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "paragraph": [
        {
          "sid": "s001",
          "text": "Chinese tech company Unitree brought its robots to the Spring Festival Gala again.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s001_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s001_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s002",
          "text": "The robots gave a great show.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s002_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s002_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s003",
          "text": "They did parkour, Drunken Fist and nunchaku.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s003_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s003_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s004",
          "text": "Their show was much better than the Yangko dance in 2025.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s004_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s004_us.mp3"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph": [
        {
          "sid": "s005",
          "text": "At the end of the show, the 1.8-metre-tall H2 robot showed a sword dance.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s005_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s005_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s006",
          "text": "At the 2026 Spring Festival Gala Yiwu sub-venue, another H2 robot wore heavy Monkey King clothes.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s006_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s006_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s007",
          "text": "It held a golden stick and stood on a “somersault cloud” with the help of robot dogs.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s007_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s007_us.mp3"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph": [
        {
          "sid": "s008",
          "text": "The robots changed formations and did kung fu while running fast.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s008_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s008_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s009",
          "text": "This new technology is good and useful for group work.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s009_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s009_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s010",
          "text": "In the future, robots can work alone or in groups in more fields.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s010_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s010_us.mp3"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph": [
        {
          "sid": "s011",
          "text": "This special robot show surprised lots of people.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s011_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s011_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s012",
          "text": "On Sina Weibo, many people talked about it.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s012_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s012_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s013",
          "text": "Some said the robots improved a lot, for they only played with handkerchiefs last year.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s013_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s013_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s014",
          "text": "Others said this year’s Gala was like a high-tech show.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s014_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s014_us.mp3"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph": [
        {
          "sid": "s015",
          "text": "One user posted the video online.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s015_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s015_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s016",
          "text": "He said the show was really amazing.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s016_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s016_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s017",
          "text": "Another said the robots could use tools, keep balance and jump well.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s017_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s017_us.mp3"
          }
        },
        {
          "sid": "s018",
          "text": "All of them loved the wonderful performance.",
          "audio": {
            "uk": "audio_segments/s018_uk.mp3",
            "us": "audio_segments/s018_us.mp3"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}